{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-01-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'KEYBANK NAMES HELENA HAYNES-CARTER AS CHIEF DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION OFFICER', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HELENA HAYNES-CARTER HAS BEEN NAMED CHIEF DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION OFFICER FOR THE COMPANY. IN THIS ROLE, HELENA WILL LEAD THE STRATEGY AND TACTICS TO IMPROVE THE ACQUISITION, DEVELOPMENT, AND RETENTION OF DIVERSE TALENT AND SUPPLIERS.'}